{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google研究人員日前宣佈，該公司的實驗性量子計算機在一種名為「魔方遊戲」的邏輯謎題中，超越了經典計算機所能達到的最佳策略。這項研究已發表於《科學》雜誌，為物理學家提供了一次在真實硬件上驗證量子「情境性」現象的機會。研究人員認為，這一現象可能是量子計算機未來能力的關鍵來源。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587874.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T19:44:25.378689+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T19:27:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T19:37:36.758208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T19:37:36.758208+00:00","content_hash":"06c6b09a94e3c0011b5f4dc3e09197925a09783b385a01efbbf5607c7e271f40","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}